+- **N12 — Parser silent fallbacks.** demo_parse.odin:165-180: unknown tier name → `standard`, unknown class → `none` (typo'd demos do the wrong thing silently); demo_parse.odin:102-115: negative seeds/times wrap through `u64(v)`/`i64(v)`; "capture at" with no times → none. Guard: error on unknown names.
