+  the live map is `rc.autopilot_wired` (`app/run/autopilot.odin:14-17`).
+- **The §10.5 diff bundle is thinner than spec'd**: `diff.json` carries only
+  frame/pixel counts/bbox (`harness/goldens.odin:128-133`) — no `first_divergent_tick`,
+  no `event_stream_delta`, no `replay.dem`; reports overwrite a single `latest/`
+  directory instead of timestamped dirs.
+- **`load_catalogs` silently mixes disk and embedded bytes per file**
+  (`app/run/catalogs.odin:33-44`): a partially-populated `data/` dir yields a hybrid
+  catalog with no warning (the hash covers the hybrid, so goldens catch drift — but the
+  dev loop can silently test something other than either source).
+- **The catalog loader's claimed "unknown fields abort" validation doesn't exist**
+  (`core/catalog.odin:1-5` vs the lenient `jstr`/`jint` accessors); `jint` also
+  silently truncates `json.Float` values (`catalog.odin:351-357`) despite the
+  "no silent int truncation" narrative.
