index 0000000..bdcae23
--- /dev/null
+++ b/demos/draw_and_upgrade.dem
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# draw_and_upgrade.dem — the upgrade journey end to end (review r1: the
+# upgrade command had no integration pin): draw standard, upgrade to wide, the
+# over-span upgrade rejection (Perkins r1), demolish refunds into the budget.
+seed 42
+map demo_six_nodes
+at 100ms draw_pipe router house_a standard -> ok
+at 200ms upgrade_pipe router-house_a wide -> ok
+at 300ms draw_pipe host router wide -> ok
+at 400ms upgrade_pipe host-router narrow -> span_exceeds_tier
